006300* ===============================================================
006400* TC-01: MOD-10 CHECK DIGIT ALGORITHM (zDVy)
006500* ===============================================================
006600 RUN-TC-01-MOD10.
006700     MOVE "12345" TO STR-ZONED(1:5).
006800     MOVE 0 TO MOD10-SUM.
006900     MOVE 2 TO WEIGHT-VAL.
007000*    -- RIGHT-TO-LEFT WEIGHTED PASS (WEIGHTS 2,1,2,1...)
007100     PERFORM VARYING I FROM 5 BY -1 UNTIL I < 1
007200         MOVE STR-ZONED(I:1) TO DIGIT-VAL
007300         MOVE DIGIT-VAL TO MOD10-PRODUCT
007310         MULTIPLY WEIGHT-VAL BY MOD10-PRODUCT END-MULTIPLY
007400         IF MOD10-PRODUCT > 9
007500             SUBTRACT 9 FROM MOD10-PRODUCT END-SUBTRACT
007600         END-IF
007700         ADD MOD10-PRODUCT TO MOD10-SUM END-ADD
008000         IF WEIGHT-VAL = 2
008100             MOVE 1 TO WEIGHT-VAL
008200         ELSE
008300             MOVE 2 TO WEIGHT-VAL
008400         END-IF
008500     END-PERFORM.
008600*    -- G9: DIVIDE/REMAINDER (STANDARD 85) VS FUNCTION REM
008610     DIVIDE MOD10-SUM BY 10 GIVING MOD10-PRODUCT
008620         REMAINDER WS-REMAINDER END-DIVIDE.
008700     IF WS-REMAINDER = 0
008710         MOVE 0 TO CHECK-DIGIT
008800     ELSE
008810         COMPUTE CHECK-DIGIT = 10 - WS-REMAINDER
008820         END-COMPUTE
008900     END-IF.
008900
009000*    -- ASSERT: THE CHECK DIGIT FOR "12345" MUST BE 5
009100     IF CHECK-DIGIT = 5
009200         MOVE "PASSED" TO WS-TEST-RESULT
009300     ELSE
009400         MOVE "FAILED" TO WS-TEST-RESULT
009500     END-IF.
009600     DISPLAY "TC-01 (zDVy Mod-10 Checksum)  : " WS-TEST-RESULT.
009700
009800* ===============================================================
009900* TC-02: COMP-3 UNPACKING AND SIGN EXTRACTION (UNPK)
010000* ===============================================================
010100 RUN-TC-02-UNPK.
010200*    -- INJECT PACKED VALUE +12345 AS RAW HEX BYTES
010300     MOVE X"12345C" TO TEST-BUFFER-IN(1:3).
010400     MOVE SPACES TO STR-ZONED.
010500     MOVE 1 TO IDX-ZONED.
010600
010700*    -- SIMULATE THE BYTE-BY-BYTE NIBBLE SWEEP ROUTINE
010800     PERFORM VARYING I FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL I > 3
010900*        -- SIMULATED BINARY LOAD OF EACH RAW BYTE
011000         EVALUATE I
011100*            X"12" = 18 DECIMAL
011200             WHEN 1 MOVE 18 TO REG-BYTE
011300*            X"34" = 52 DECIMAL
011400             WHEN 2 MOVE 52 TO REG-BYTE
011500*            X"5C" = 92 DECIMAL
011600             WHEN 3 MOVE 92 TO REG-BYTE
011700         END-EVALUATE
011800*        -- G9: SINGLE DIVIDE/REMAINDER (STANDARD 85)
011810         DIVIDE REG-BYTE BY 16 GIVING NIBBLE-HIGH
011820             REMAINDER NIBBLE-LOW END-DIVIDE
012000         IF I = 3
012100*            -- LAST BYTE: FINAL DIGIT + SIGN (C = POSITIVE)
012200             MOVE NIBBLE-HIGH TO NIB-DIG
012300             MOVE NIB-DIG TO STR-ZONED(IDX-ZONED:1)
012400         ELSE
012500             MOVE NIBBLE-HIGH TO NIB-DIG
012600             MOVE NIB-DIG TO STR-ZONED(IDX-ZONED:1)
012700             MOVE NIBBLE-LOW TO NIB-DIG
012800             MOVE NIB-DIG TO STR-ZONED(IDX-ZONED + 1:1)
012900             ADD 2 TO IDX-ZONED END-ADD
013000         END-IF
013100     END-PERFORM.
013200
013300*    -- ASSERT: THE UNPACKED STRING MUST BE "12345"
013400     IF STR-ZONED(1:5) = "12345"
013500         MOVE "PASSED" TO WS-TEST-RESULT
013600     ELSE
013700         MOVE "FAILED" TO WS-TEST-RESULT
013800     END-IF.
013900     DISPLAY "TC-02 (UNPK Mainframe COMP-3) : " WS-TEST-RESULT.
014000
014100* ===============================================================
014200* TC-03: ACTIVE CORRECTIVE CONSISTENCY VALIDATION (INCON ND)
014300* ===============================================================
014400 RUN-TC-03-INCON-ND.
014500*    -- FIELD WITH ALPHABETIC GARBAGE IN A NUMERIC ZONE
014600     MOVE "ARG12A45" TO TEST-BUFFER-IN(1:8).
014700*    -- SIMULATE THE INCON CARD: CLEAN POSITIONS 4 TO 6
014800     PERFORM VARYING K FROM 4 BY 1 UNTIL K > 6
014900         IF TEST-BUFFER-IN(K:1) NOT NUMERIC
015000             MOVE "0" TO TEST-BUFFER-IN(K:1)
015100         END-IF
015200     END-PERFORM.
015300
015400*    -- ASSERT: THE LETTER "A" MUST BE FORCED TO "0"
015500     IF TEST-BUFFER-IN(1:8) = "ARG12045"
015600         MOVE "PASSED" TO WS-TEST-RESULT
015700     ELSE
015800         MOVE "FAILED" TO WS-TEST-RESULT
015900     END-IF.
016000     DISPLAY "TC-03 (INCON ND Active Clean) : " WS-TEST-RESULT.
