018400* TC-05: CONDITIONAL LOGICAL INDICATOR MATRIX (COND/FIELDx)
018500* ===============================================================
018600 RUN-TC-05-COND-FLAGS.
018700*    -- BRANCH FIELD
018800     MOVE "0501" TO TEST-BUFFER-IN(1:4).
018900     MOVE "N" TO COND-FLAG-MATRIX(1).
